---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Teaching">
  <h1>Teaching</h1>
  <p>
    I was a teaching assistant for two mechanical engineering courses at the University of Utah,
    and I mentor undergraduates in the lab.
  </p>

  <h2>University of Utah, Department of Mechanical Engineering</h2>
  <div class="entry">
    <h3>ME EN 1010: Computer-Based Problem Solving for Engineering Systems</h3>
    <div class="where">Teaching Assistant · Spring 2024, Spring 2025, Fall 2025</div>
    <p>
      Introduction to analysis, modeling and control using MATLAB and C for microcontrollers. Labs
      used kinematic modeling and robot-controlled solenoids to launch ping pong balls into targets
      in a class-wide competition. I served as head TA, taught labs and lectures, and graded
      assignments, labs and exams.
    </p>
  </div>
  <div class="entry">
    <h3>ME EN 2030: Dynamics</h3>
    <div class="where">Teaching Assistant · Fall 2024, Spring 2025</div>
    <p>
      Kinematics and kinetics of particles and rigid bodies, from moving reference frames to
      impact and an introduction to vibrations. I was the sole TA for 100+ students, holding
      office hours and grading.
    </p>
  </div>

  <h2>Mentoring and outreach</h2>
  <div class="entry">
    <h3>Graduate researcher, Washington University in St. Louis</h3>
    <p>Mentoring undergraduates and training them in laboratory safety and procedures.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="entry">
    <h3>3D4E (founder and vice-president)</h3>
    <div class="where">University of Utah · Dec. 2024 – present</div>
    <p>
      A 3D printing club that teaches CAD and additive manufacturing to STEM and non-STEM students
      across campus.
    </p>
  </div>
</Layout>
